WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:06.498
I don't like admitting that I became a commodity.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:12.620
I confuse being admired with being loved.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:18.059
Is it the likes or is it marketing?

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:22.660
Don't ask me for consistency.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.420
I don't believe in religion.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:33.340
I'm tired. But once again I force myself to work.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.180
Guilt. Capitalism.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.300
Neoliberalism. Optimism.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.860
They don't let me rest.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:45.340
I should consider being more considerate.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:50.260
But please for your consideration.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:54.540
I need to belong. I can't stop.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:01:01.307
When I get sad on the internet, I find understanding.

00:01:01.307 --> 00:01:07.589
And not in a figurative sense, because I'm anti-simulation.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.561
Anti-actress, anti-singer, anti-Hellenist.

00:01:10.588 --> 00:01:13.030
I'm a dumb feminist.

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:17.550
I have nothing to lose.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:22.657
Let the world burn, because I've already won.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.908
To be or not to be, that is the question.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.790
My body pays for what my name earns.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.750
Like a sentence. It's therapy.

00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:02.860
I sell intimacy. Songs with ego and insecurity.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:07.419
It's not ambition, it's survival.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:16.064
And to be honest, I have no idea what I'm doing.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:23.217
I want to sit on the toilet looking at my phone until my legs go numb.

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:27.059
Get as fat as I want, with no human interaction.

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:29.340
Watch TV shows all day.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.580
But I must keep going. The world demands that I keep going.

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:41.060
That's why I ask for your consideration.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:20.930
"Femme fatale," says a headline.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:28.561
So casually.

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:32.330
As if they knew me.

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:36.530
As if I'm black in springtime.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:43.075
Welcome. The show must go on.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:51.010
I dress sadness in red satin.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:57.720
With tons of solitude.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:03.359
Pantomime on stage.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.600
Accommodating, as always.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:12.600
Dreaming of some sobriety.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:21.582
I carry the chaos of promises with my lips.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.440
A poem.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:28.040
Lethal revolution.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:33.520
I have nothing to lose.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:36.240
Let the world burn.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:44.051
I just wanted them to love me, nothing more.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:51.560
I do it again, I burn it all down.

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:59.670
I'm an expert in the art of sabotage.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:09.270
So many years trying to figure out who I am.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:13.221
Maybe I am.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:19.110
That femme fatale.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:49.910
I carry chaos as a promise with my lips.

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:56.010
A poem in lethal revolution.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:01.010
I have nothing to lose.

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.290
Let the world burn.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:09.770
I just wanted to be loved, nothing more.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:18.529
And to explain to you, my heart.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:25.010
I am anxiety attacks.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:34.808
In my voice, I have a kingdom of storms in spring.

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:42.463
Please, a big round of applause.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:54.331
For the femme fatale.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:20.100
Ready.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.620
Let's go.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:54.650
Monserrat, we need to have a serious talk 
about expectations and insecurity.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:08:00.490
That you do everything wrong. Who cares?

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:04.410
We're going to die. They're going to forget us anyway.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:09.170
And I think about Botox and experimental music.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:13.730
About my mother and the loneliness of a world tour.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:19.610
Maybe I'll be better off when I don't try to be either young or normal.

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:24.610
Hide my ghosts and finally learn to love myself.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.769
I should learn to love myself.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.570
I'm going to pick up my pieces.

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:50.200
I should learn to love myself.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:03.640
I want to learn to love myself,
but I know myself too well.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.920
Hello Monserrat.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:32.960
Hello Miss Empathy, my queen, who gives all of herself.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:42.679
The complexity in me is a romantic poem with senile dementia.

00:09:43.315 --> 00:09:48.310
I think about how many things I take for my mental health.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:52.870
And how many taxes I have to pay this month.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:58.750
Maybe I'll be better when I don't try to be young or normal.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:03.790
Bury my ghosts and finally learn to love myself.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:10.981
I should learn to love myself.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:20.110
I'm going to pick up my pieces.

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:29.230
I should learn to love myself.

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:42.750
I want to learn to love myself, but I know myself too well.

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:30.860
Thank you.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:09.750
Your dreams, past.

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:15.030
You have to give them a chance.

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:20.430
Miracles are just one day at a time.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:28.630
On this journey, I want to sit next to you.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:33.029
If you let me, I can go with you.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:37.389
My stubborn heart won't give up.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:45.840
You aren't empty.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.240
I feel you when you kiss me.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:57.000
I exist in your potential.

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:03.520
Love, how I would love.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:08.440
For you to see yourself the way I see you.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:16.159
I still believe that my love can save us.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:26.360
Sometimes I am so afraid.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.600
You are not like him.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.400
Don't give him your heart.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:41.290
Don't give him your heart.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.330
Sometimes I am so afraid.

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:49.410
You are not like him.

