Miracles are just one day at a time.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:08.210
Miracles are just one day at a time.

00:14:09.290 --> 00:14:11.410
The miracle is you.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.930
The miracle is you.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.090
The miracle is you.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:24.730
The miracle is you.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.460
Love of my life.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:50.019
I will never forget this trip with our seven-month-old son.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.860
Right now, I'm on the ferry to Venice crying tears of joy.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:58.300
I just love you so much. I love our friendship and every part of you.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:01.259
I love your hair, your sense of humor, your vampire teeth.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.620
Your scent, especially when you haven't showered.

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:09.860
I love when you get excited and your eyes fill with tears.

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.900
I love your kindness, your belly button, your neck.

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:16.820
I love seeing you smile with that sweet smile 
that you make when you shrug your shoulders.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:21.900
You know what I love most in life is our son's sweet face or anything about him.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:26.302
Right now, there are only a few minutes until I can finally touch you.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.579
I love you so much in the water, in the deepest depths.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.140
At the lighthouse at midnight.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.580
I love you so much.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.740
I love you so much.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.980
I love you so much.

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.350
I love you so much.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:55.310
OK.

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.070
Sorry.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:12.310
Thank you.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:12.829
Audience:
I love you!

00:16:13.925 --> 00:16:14.633
I love you.

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:19.110
OK. Did my lipstick stay on?

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.150
Yes. No. My lipstick smudged.

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:22.350
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:24.750
Let's go.

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.430
Oh. Two, three.

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:38.410
Today I woke up.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:44.290
I lit a cigarette and poured myself coffee.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:54.970
I took my son to school and on the way back home I cried.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:04.770
When I got back, I went to change my clothes.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:09.810
I looked at myself naked in the mirror and cried again.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:19.912
Who is that woman who looks more and more like my mom?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:30.450
I took my six pills, put on a face mask.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:35.079
I found a new wrinkle, for a change.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:42.920
When I brushed my teeth, I laughed intensely.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:47.240
It's another day. One more day.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.999
I don't want to be bipolar.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:58.831
I just want a normal life.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:05.978
Sometimes I fall back down.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:12.080
I think I'm a bit addicted to stress.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.280
At least I quit drinking.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:22.600
Even though I get bored, I know it's better this way.

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:29.440
So I go back to the pills.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:32.609
More coffee and more cigarette butts.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:36.930
I've buried myself in work, for a change.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:41.770
I brush my teeth again.

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:44.810
I don't laugh, I'm zoned out.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:48.690
It's another day, one more day.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:53.290
None of that bipolar shit.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:19:00.746
I just want a normal life.

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:33.940
And no, no, I won't let it defeat me.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:38.060
The drama queen is in the past.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:40.740
The femme fatale.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.060
I'm going to quit smoking.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.300
I'm going to lose weight.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.699
I'll be the best mom.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:53.797
I'll fix everything, boom, boom, boom everyday, every night!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:56.500
I've never been better.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.860
I'm full of love.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:01.948
I will overcome.

00:20:02.813 --> 00:20:23.099
And have the most extremely normal life.

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:58.410
My snot is everywhere. It's OK.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.130
Well, that's fine. We're all set.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.570
Ready? We're all set.

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:19.690
Felix:
Thank everybody, thank you for coming.

